---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: chbench_q1"
---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |  Sort: order_line.ol_number ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |   Projection: order_line.ol_number, sum(order_line.ol_quantity) AS sum_qty, sum(order_line.ol_amount) AS sum_amount, avg(order_line.ol_quantity) AS avg_qty, avg(order_line.ol_amount) AS avg_amount, count(Int64(1)) AS count_order                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[order_line.ol_number]], aggr=[[sum(order_line.ol_quantity), sum(order_line.ol_amount), avg(order_line.ol_quantity), avg(order_line.ol_amount), count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |       TableScan: order_line projection=[ol_number, ol_quantity, ol_amount], full_filters=[order_line.ol_delivery_d > Utf8("2007-01-02 00:00:00.000000")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=//data/accelerated_duckdb.db base_sql=SELECT "order_line"."ol_number", sum("order_line"."ol_quantity") AS "sum_qty", sum("order_line"."ol_amount") AS "sum_amount", avg("order_line"."ol_quantity") AS "avg_qty", avg("order_line"."ol_amount") AS "avg_amount", count(1) AS "count_order" FROM "order_line" WHERE ("order_line"."ol_delivery_d" > '2007-01-02 00:00:00.000000') GROUP BY "order_line"."ol_number" ORDER BY "order_line"."ol_number" ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
